{"page":484,"verses":[{"verse_key":"42:11","surah":42,"ayah":11,"ar_uthmani":"فَاطِرُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ جَعَلَ لَكُم مِّنْ أَنفُسِكُمْ أَزْوَٰجًا وَمِنَ ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ أَزْوَٰجًا ۖ يَذْرَؤُكُمْ فِيهِ ۚ لَيْسَ كَمِثْلِهِۦ شَىْءٌ ۖ وَهُوَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلْبَصِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"the Creator of the heavens and earth.’ He made mates for you from among yourselves––and for the animals too––so that you may multiply. There is nothing like Him: He is the All Hearing, the All Seeing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَاطِرُ","en_gloss":"(The) Creator","transliteration":"fāṭiru","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":4,"ar":"جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"He made","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَنفُسِكُمْ","en_gloss":"yourselves","transliteration":"anfusikum","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَزْوَٰجًۭا","en_gloss":"mates","transliteration":"azwājan","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمِنَ","en_gloss":"and among","transliteration":"wamina","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ","en_gloss":"the cattle","transliteration":"l-anʿāmi","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَزْوَٰجًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"mates","transliteration":"azwājan","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَذْرَؤُكُمْ","en_gloss":"He multiplies you","transliteration":"yadhra-ukum","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِيهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"thereby","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَيْسَ","en_gloss":"(There) is not","transliteration":"laysa","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كَمِثْلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"like Him","transliteration":"kamith'lihi","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":16,"ar":"شَىْءٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"anything","transliteration":"shayon","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلسَّمِيعُ","en_gloss":"(is) the All-Hearer","transliteration":"l-samīʿu","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلْبَصِيرُ","en_gloss":"the All-Seer","transliteration":"l-baṣīru","verse_key":"42:11"},{"pos":20,"ar":"١١","en_gloss":"(11)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"42:11"}]},{"verse_key":"42:12","surah":42,"ayah":12,"ar_uthmani":"لَهُۥ مَقَالِيدُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ يَبْسُطُ ٱلرِّزْقَ لِمَن يَشَآءُ وَيَقْدِرُ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ بِكُلِّ شَىْءٍ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The keys of the heavens and the earth are His; He provides abundantly or sparingly for whoever He will; He has full knowledge of all things.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"To Him (belongs)","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"42:12"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَقَالِيدُ","en_gloss":"(the) keys","transliteration":"maqālīdu","verse_key":"42:12"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"42:12"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"42:12"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَبْسُطُ","en_gloss":"He extends","transliteration":"yabsuṭu","verse_key":"42:12"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلرِّزْقَ","en_gloss":"the provision","transliteration":"l-riz'qa","verse_key":"42:12"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِمَن","en_gloss":"for whom","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"42:12"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"42:12"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَيَقْدِرُ ۚ","en_gloss":"and restricts","transliteration":"wayaqdiru","verse_key":"42:12"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"42:12"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِكُلِّ","en_gloss":"of every","transliteration":"bikulli","verse_key":"42:12"},{"pos":12,"ar":"شَىْءٍ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"42:12"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"42:12"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٢","en_gloss":"(12)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"42:12"}]},{"verse_key":"42:13","surah":42,"ayah":13,"ar_uthmani":"۞ شَرَعَ لَكُم مِّنَ ٱلدِّينِ مَا وَصَّىٰ بِهِۦ نُوحًا وَٱلَّذِىٓ أَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْكَ وَمَا وَصَّيْنَا بِهِۦٓ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَمُوسَىٰ وَعِيسَىٰٓ ۖ أَنْ أَقِيمُوا۟ ٱلدِّينَ وَلَا تَتَفَرَّقُوا۟ فِيهِ ۚ كَبُرَ عَلَى ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ مَا تَدْعُوهُمْ إِلَيْهِ ۚ ٱللَّهُ يَجْتَبِىٓ إِلَيْهِ مَن يَشَآءُ وَيَهْدِىٓ إِلَيْهِ مَن يُنِيبُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In matters of faith, He has laid down for you [people] the same commandment that He gave Noah, which We have revealed to you [Muhammad] and which We enjoined on Abraham and Moses and Jesus: ‘Uphold the faith and do not divide into factions within it’- what you [Prophet] call upon the idolaters to do is hard for them; God chooses whoever He pleases for Himself and guides towards Himself those who turn to Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ شَرَعَ","en_gloss":"He has ordained","transliteration":"sharaʿa","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلدِّينِ","en_gloss":"the religion","transliteration":"l-dīni","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَصَّىٰ","en_gloss":"He enjoined","transliteration":"waṣṣā","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"upon","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":8,"ar":"نُوحًۭا","en_gloss":"Nuh","transliteration":"nūḥan","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"and that which","transliteration":"wa-alladhī","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"We have revealed","transliteration":"awḥaynā","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَصَّيْنَا","en_gloss":"We enjoined","transliteration":"waṣṣaynā","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"upon","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَمُوسَىٰ","en_gloss":"and Musa","transliteration":"wamūsā","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَعِيسَىٰٓ ۖ","en_gloss":"and Isa","transliteration":"waʿīsā","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أَنْ","en_gloss":"To","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":19,"ar":"أَقِيمُوا۟","en_gloss":"establish","transliteration":"aqīmū","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱلدِّينَ","en_gloss":"the religion","transliteration":"l-dīna","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":21,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":22,"ar":"تَتَفَرَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"be divided","transliteration":"tatafarraqū","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":23,"ar":"فِيهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":24,"ar":"كَبُرَ","en_gloss":"Is difficult","transliteration":"kabura","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":25,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":26,"ar":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","en_gloss":"the polytheists","transliteration":"l-mush'rikīna","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":27,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":28,"ar":"تَدْعُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"you call them","transliteration":"tadʿūhum","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":29,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"to it","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":30,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"42:13"},{"pos":31,"ar":"يَجْتَبِىٓ","en_gloss":"chooses","transliteratio