27,"ar":"لَفِى","en_gloss":"(are) surely in","transliteration":"lafī","verse_key":"42:14"},{"pos":28,"ar":"شَكٍّۢ","en_gloss":"doubt","transliteration":"shakkin","verse_key":"42:14"},{"pos":29,"ar":"مِّنْهُ","en_gloss":"concerning it ","transliteration":"min'hu","verse_key":"42:14"},{"pos":30,"ar":"مُرِيبٍۢ","en_gloss":"disquieting","transliteration":"murībin","verse_key":"42:14"},{"pos":31,"ar":"١٤","en_gloss":"(14)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"42:14"}]},{"verse_key":"42:15","surah":42,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"فَلِذَٰلِكَ فَٱدْعُ ۖ وَٱسْتَقِمْ كَمَآ أُمِرْتَ ۖ وَلَا تَتَّبِعْ أَهْوَآءَهُمْ ۖ وَقُلْ ءَامَنتُ بِمَآ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ مِن كِتَـٰبٍ ۖ وَأُمِرْتُ لِأَعْدِلَ بَيْنَكُمُ ۖ ٱللَّهُ رَبُّنَا وَرَبُّكُمْ ۖ لَنَآ أَعْمَـٰلُنَا وَلَكُمْ أَعْمَـٰلُكُمْ ۖ لَا حُجَّةَ بَيْنَنَا وَبَيْنَكُمُ ۖ ٱللَّهُ يَجْمَعُ بَيْنَنَا ۖ وَإِلَيْهِ ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So [Prophet] call people to that faith and follow the straight path as you have been commanded. Do not go by what they desire, but say, ‘I believe in whatever Scripture God has sent down. I am commanded to bring justice between you. God is our Lord and your Lord- to us our deeds and to you yours, so let there be no argument between us and you- God will gather us together, and to Him we shall return.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلِذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"So to that","transliteration":"falidhālika","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فَٱدْعُ ۖ","en_gloss":"then invite","transliteration":"fa-ud'ʿu","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٱسْتَقِمْ","en_gloss":"and stand firm","transliteration":"wa-is'taqim","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَمَآ","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُمِرْتَ ۖ","en_gloss":"you are commanded","transliteration":"umir'ta","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَتَّبِعْ","en_gloss":"follow","transliteration":"tattabiʿ","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَهْوَآءَهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"their desires","transliteration":"ahwāahum","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَقُلْ","en_gloss":"but say","transliteration":"waqul","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ءَامَنتُ","en_gloss":"I believe","transliteration":"āmantu","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِمَآ","en_gloss":"in what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"Allah has sent down","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has sent down","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كِتَـٰبٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"(the) Book","transliteration":"kitābin","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَأُمِرْتُ","en_gloss":"and I am commanded","transliteration":"wa-umir'tu","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لِأَعْدِلَ","en_gloss":"that I do justice","transliteration":"li-aʿdila","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":18,"ar":"بَيْنَكُمُ ۖ","en_gloss":"between you","transliteration":"baynakumu","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":20,"ar":"رَبُّنَا","en_gloss":"(is) our Lord","transliteration":"rabbunā","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":21,"ar":"وَرَبُّكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"and your Lord","transliteration":"warabbukum","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":22,"ar":"لَنَآ","en_gloss":"For us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":23,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلُنَا","en_gloss":"our deeds","transliteration":"aʿmālunā","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":24,"ar":"وَلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"and for you","transliteration":"walakum","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":25,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلُكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"your deeds","transliteration":"aʿmālukum","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":26,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(There is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"42:15"},{"pos":27,"ar":"حُجَّةَ","en_gloss":"argument","transliteration":"ḥujjata","verse_key